      "title": "Key trade-offs",
      "items": [
        "URL frontier: Often priority-based: the most authoritative pages first.",
        "DNS: It's cached and several providers are used in rotation.",
        "Seen set: A bloom filter (great on space) has rare false positives; a DB index (good) is simpler and exact.",
